    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a quiet, deliberate way to step out? i dont know if i have the strength to fight for a place here anymore. it just feels so exhausting to keep pretending i belong in a world that doesn't have a shape for me anymore. like i'm just taking up space that belongs to something newer.",
